{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09975","headline":"塞下曲 · 薛奇童","name":"塞下曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"骄虏初南下，烟尘暗国中。\n独召李将军，夜开甘泉宫。\n一身许明主，万里总元戎。\n霜甲卧不暖，夜半闻边风。\n胡天早飞雪，荒徼多转蓬。\n寒云覆水重，秋气连海空。\n金鞍谁家子，上马鸣角弓。\n自是幽幷客，非论爱立功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛奇童","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09975.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09975","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}